OL,3,GNEWSARain returns but parts of Sussex
OL,4,Astill in severe drought
OL,5,
OL,6,FStorm Austen and Storm Boelo, the first
OL,7,Ftwo named storms of the season, have
OL,8,Fbrought lashing rain and heavy winds to
OL,9,FSussex.
OL,11,FDamage included part of Brighton's
OL,12,Ficonic West Pier collapsing into the
OL,13,Fsea, one side of a petrol station roof
OL,14,Fin Newhaven coming loose, and a tree
OL,15,Ffalling on to a platform at Angmering
OL,16,Fstation.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
