OL,3,GNEWSARain returns but parts of Sussex
OL,4,Astill in severe drought
OL,5,
OL,6,FOver the summer the UK experienced
OL,7,Fmultiple heatwaves and record-breaking
OL,8,Ftemperatures, with parts of the county
OL,9,Fin a "severe drought" following a
OL,10,Fdeclaration made by the government
OL,11,Fearlier this month.
OL,13,FBut now the weather has turned wet and
OL,14,Fwindy - so why is Sussex still in a
OL,15,Fsevere drought?
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
